This file makes colcon skip this directory when it looks for packages.

The package below, nav2_collision_monitor, shadows Nav2's package of the same
name with the Lean-backed node, which refuses every configuration that is not
stop or slowdown zones on one laser scan, Nav2's default included. It must
not be built because this repository happens to be in a workspace. To build
it, name its directory:

  colcon build --base-paths src src/ROSlean/overlay/opt_in/nav2_collision_monitor \
    --packages-up-to nav2_collision_monitor

See docs/DROP_IN_COLLISION_MONITOR.md.
